WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.600
Alex is a quite distracted person.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.710
Oh no, I forgot the towel.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.280
Oh... did I close all the windows?

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:12.670
Oh, my passport!

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.560
Oh, a butterfly.

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:17.610
Whoaaaa!

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:21.400
Now he has Checklist Pro!

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:26.870
No more missing items, things done three times faster,
and routine under control.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.540
Done, done, and done!

